  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "The change-of-coordinates matrix from the basis $B$ to the basis $C$ and the coordinates of the vector $x$ relative to the basis $B$ are given below. What is $[x]_{C}?$ \n\n$$\n{P}_{B\\to C}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
